dbt's macros
============

The files under dbt-adapters/ and dbt-postgres/ are dbt's own macros,
copied unchanged from the dbt repository (https://github.com/dbt-labs/dbt,
crates/dbt-loader/src/dbt_macro_assets/, commit
a3bdd96bf62f02c8babb060a79f32de6998c235a, the dbt v2.0.5 release). They
are maintained upstream in dbt-labs/dbt-adapters
(https://github.com/dbt-labs/dbt-adapters).

